This is an unofficial, non-commercial fan project. It is not affiliated
with, authorised by or endorsed by the rights holder of the original game.

What this repository contains:
  - Go source code written for this project, which reimplements the game's
    logic natively. The engine executes no original program code.
  - Tools that read a user-supplied ROM image to rebuild the game's assets
    locally.

What this repository does NOT contain or distribute:
  - The original ROM image.
  - Graphics, sound data, text, disassembly listings or any other data
    extracted from the ROM, in raw or decoded form.

To run the port you must supply your own copy of the original cartridge
ROM. If you are a rights holder and have a concern about this project,
please open an issue and it will be addressed promptly.
